<title>NORWAY: Oil loadings, output normal at Norway N.Sea fields.</title>
<headline>Oil loadings, output normal at Norway N.Sea fields.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Den norske oljeselskap AS (Statoil) said on Tuesday all crude oil loadings and production at the North Sea Statfjord and Gullfaks oilfields were normal.</p>
<p>&quot;There is one tanker loading at Gullfaks and one at Statfjord. The weather is fine and the forecast is good,&quot; a Statoil spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Oil loadings into shuttle tankers at the offshore buoys are often disrupted during winter due to high winds and swell.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
